WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.430
[THEME MUSIC]

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.140
GREG HUTCHINS: Thank
you all for coming.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:11.010
In the next 50
minutes or so, I'm

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.530
going to tell you all
how exactly to build

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:16.870
a wildly successful enterprise
application using Google Cloud

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.102
Platform.

00:00:18.102 --> 00:00:19.380
I'm Greg Hutchins.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:23.225
